          "@value": "Compile LaTeX in a container"
        }
      ],
      "skos:definition": [
        {
          "@value": "Compile a rendered paper's `main.tex` with latexmk inside a TeX Live (full) image, for a host with Docker but no TeX engine. The image carries TeX Live, latexmk, Pandoc, latexdiff, graphviz and poppler-utils; it does not run the content pipeline, which renders the chapters on the host first."
        }
      ],
      "skos:notation": "latex-image",
