          "@value": "Render a paper's content objects to LaTeX chapters: load the paper manifest, resolve its chapters and blocks, render, validate the LaTeX AST, and write the chapter files. With no manifest it builds the folio's only paper, and refuses — naming them — when there are several or none."
        }
      ],
      "skos:notation": "paper-latex-build",
