          "@value": "Install TeX Live in a sandbox"
        }
      ],
      "skos:definition": [
        {
          "@value": "Install TeX Live (full) and latexmk where no TeX engine is present, disabling the firewalled launchpad PPAs that otherwise abort `apt-get update`. Idempotent: does nothing when pdflatex and memoize.sty are already present. About 5 GB and 10-20 minutes, so run it in the background. pdflatex unpacks early but is not usable until the post-install format build ends (`kpsewhich memoize.sty` returning a path is the ready signal)."
        }
      ],
      "skos:notation": "tex-install",
